  "path_redaction": "Only the absolute workspace prefix in early-settlement.log changed, in 2 fields, to <fixture-workspace>. Its source and export hashes are distinct. Every other file is byte-identical to its source commit. The traces are published as recorded: the program_artifacts section of each names the three program binaries by their absolute paths on the machine that ran them.",
  "source_files": "The three files under source/foundation/onchain/ are the build inputs whose hashes are not already published, copied byte for byte at the program_source commit. Their SHA-256 values equal the entries for the same paths in the traces' build_inputs. Three other build inputs are identical to files under ../pinned-price/source/, one to a file under ../pinned-delivery/source/ and the remaining 62 to files under ../source/. The base commit's program source is the program source of the pinned-price record. The three files under source/foundation/test-programs/delivery-rule/ are the source of the rule program both runs loaded, at the same commit, and their SHA-256 values equal rule_program.source_sha256 in the receipt. The files retain their existing copyright, and this release adds no license grant for them."
